  },
  GridBoxDividers->{
   "Columns" -> {{True}}, "Rows" -> {{True}}}]], "Text"],

Cell["\<\
Peer values come from the class final-data sheet (group A).  My 4-filter \
result sits with the other class masses; terminal velocity generally rises \
with mass for these runs, with scatter from trial-to-trial variation.\
\>", "Text"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"classRows", "=", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"2.351", ",", "2.1146"}], "}"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"3.49", ",", "2.43525"}], "}"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"4.6655", ",", "2.6471"}], "}"}], ",", 
