   "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{"ImageSize", "\[Rule]", "Large"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{"GridLines", "\[Rule]", "Automatic"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{"PlotLegends", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"PointLegend", "[", 
     RowBox[{"Automatic", ",", 
      RowBox[{"{", "\"\<group A peers\>\"", "}"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"LegendFunction", "\[Rule]", "\"\<Frame\>\""}]}], "]"}]}]}], 
  "]"}]], "Input"],

Cell["\<\
Overall, four coffee filters of mass 4.6655 g reached a mean terminal \
velocity of 2.6471 m/s.  The marks of quality (R^2 near 1 and unstructured \
residuals) support treating the linear terminal region as a good model for \
vt.  Compared with peers on the final-data sheet, the result is consistent \
with a heavier stack falling faster once drag balances weight.\
\>", "Text"]

}, Open]]

